WEBVTT

00:01:29.996 --> 00:01:32.246
and Southwest eventually offered buyouts.

00:01:32.788 --> 00:01:36.038
I hadn't even really thought about
my retirement moment yet because

00:01:36.038 --> 00:01:38.829
I had 10 more years to fly and
I wasn't planning on leaving.

00:01:39.163 --> 00:01:42.288
But after some serious reflection,
she chose to retire.

00:01:42.746 --> 00:01:45.538
So we're a couple of hundred that retired
in the same two week period,

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:46.829
which is unheard of.

00:01:47.663 --> 00:01:48.996
Despite all the turbulence,

00:01:48.996 --> 00:01:53.204
Sharon knows she's lucky she looked beyond
the horizon to a new career.

00:01:53.704 --> 00:01:56.871
More on that later. But
for now, buckle up.